<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns four auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns four auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all four auctions it had offered in order to drain 2.443 billion pesos in the secondary market on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    400 million    16 days   23.30 pct</p>
<p>    681 million    10 days   23.38 pct</p>
<p>    681 million     9 days   23.25 pct</p>
<p>    681 million     2 days   22.80 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
